WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:01.668
- That's a sad reality

00:00:01.668 --> 00:00:02.969
because even in my country,

00:00:02.969 --> 00:00:04.471 align:start size:81% position:19%
when I was growing
up in Lebanon,

00:00:04.471 --> 00:00:06.238 align:start size:84% position:16%
remember Lebanon
was the only country

00:00:06.238 --> 00:00:07.373
to accept the third wave

00:00:07.373 --> 00:00:09.843 align:start size:88% position:13%
of Palestinian refugees
into the country

00:00:09.843 --> 00:00:11.745
in 1974, '75.

00:00:11.745 --> 00:00:13.580
I was a 10 year old little girl.

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:15.148
My father owned a restaurant,

00:00:15.148 --> 00:00:16.616
and we were watching the images

00:00:16.616 --> 00:00:20.419 align:start position:0%
of the Palestinians coming
into Lebanon on our television,

00:00:20.419 --> 00:00:22.188
the first TV in town.

00:00:22.188 --> 00:00:24.557 align:start size:97% position:3%
And I would hear the
conversations on the tables

00:00:24.557 --> 00:00:25.725
in the restaurant,

00:00:25.725 --> 00:00:26.759 align:start size:84% position:16%
you know, people
talking to each other.

00:00:26.759 --> 00:00:28.327
"Oh, the bloody Jews.

00:00:28.327 --> 00:00:30.496
Look what they're doing
to the Palestinians."

00:00:30.496 --> 00:00:33.833
The general teaching, not
in my household, obviously,

00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:35.135
because we are Christians,

00:00:35.135 --> 00:00:38.638
but the general teaching
across the Arabic world

00:00:38.638 --> 00:00:40.740
is Israel is Satan.

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:41.808
(speaking foreign language)

00:00:41.808 --> 00:00:42.976
This has not changed.

00:00:42.976 --> 00:00:44.511
It actually got worse

00:00:44.511 --> 00:00:46.746 align:start size:88% position:13%
because in the
Palestinian Territories,

00:00:46.746 --> 00:00:49.282 align:start size:88% position:13%
they teach the children
to hate the Jews

00:00:49.282 --> 00:00:51.017
because the Jews have horns,

00:00:51.017 --> 00:00:52.285
the Jews are evil,

00:00:52.285 --> 00:00:53.753
the Jews are satanic,

00:00:53.753 --> 00:00:57.390
and this is why you see
the barbarism happening.

00:00:57.390 --> 00:00:59.659
But the barbarism is not new,

00:00:59.659 --> 00:01:01.694 align:start size:88% position:13%
and it's all not
directed at Israel only.

00:01:01.694 --> 00:01:03.929
You know, this is why people
think, "Oh my gosh, Hamas,

00:01:03.929 --> 00:01:06.632 align:start position:0%
you know, we need to feel sorry
for the poor Palestinians."

00:01:06.632 --> 00:01:09.569 align:start size:97% position:3%
People need to understand that
throughout the Middle East,

00:01:09.569 --> 00:01:12.405 align:start size:88% position:13%
they have zero tolerance
for minorities,

00:01:12.405 --> 00:01:15.675 align:start size:84% position:16%
and Israel is the
bullseye in their eye

00:01:15.675 --> 00:01:18.378 align:start size:84% position:16%
because they could
not kick Israelis out.

00:01:18.378 --> 00:01:21.014
(upbeat music)

00:01:25.218 --> 00:01:27.687 align:start size:97% position:3%
- I'm Dave Rubin, and joining
me today is an author,

00:01:27.687 --> 00:01:29.355
a national security expert,

00:01:29.355 --> 00:01:33.425 align:start position:0%
and founder of Act for America,
my friend Brigitte Gabriel.

00:01:33.425 --> 00:01:35.995
Brigitte, welcome back
to "The Rubin Report."

00:01:35.995 --> 00:01:37.263
- Hello my friend.

00:01:37.263 --> 00:01:39.566
I'm delighted to be
back with you again.

00:01:39.566 --> 00:01:41.267
- I'm so glad to see you.

00:01:41.267 --> 00:01:43.570
We don't see each other enough.

00:01:43.570 --> 00:01:44.838
I have to say before we start,

00:01:44.838 --> 00:01:47.207
that you accomplished something

00:01:47.207 --> 00:01:49.309 align:start size:84% position:16%
that no other
"Rubin Report" guest

00:01:49.309 --> 00:01:52.278
has ever done in all of
the years of the show.

00:01:52.278 --> 00:01:56.015
You are the only guest who
ever brought tears to my eyes

00:01:56.015 --> 00:01:58.451
during a live episode.

00:01:58.451 --> 00:02:01.053
We'll link to the
clip down below.

00:02:01.053 --> 00:02:03.289
But you were giving
a wonderful soliloquy

00:02:03.289 --> 00:02:05.458 align:start size:94% position:6%
about America and freedom
and the importance

00:02:05.458 --> 00:02:07.393
of fighting for freedom,

00:02:07.393 --> 00:02:10.496 align:start size:97% position:3%
and you actually brought tears
to my eyes during the show.

00:02:10.496 --> 00:02:12.798
And I feel like that's something

00:02:12.798 --> 00:02:14.801
that has meaning,
that has meaning.

00:02:14.801 --> 00:02:15.635
- Yes, it does.

00:02:15.635 --> 00:02:16.869
You know why?

00:02:16.869 --> 00:02:18.438 align:start size:84% position:16%
Because you and I
share the same soul.

00:02:18.438 --> 00:02:20.506
We care about what
happens in the world.

00:02:20.506 --> 00:02:22.408
We care about human suffering.

00:02:22.408 --> 00:02:24.544 align:start size:84% position:16%
It doesn't matter
who are these humans.

00:02:24.544 --> 00:02:26.011 align:start size:84% position:16%
You know, they could
be Palestinians,

00:02:26.011 --> 00:02:28.148
they could be Muslims,
Christians, Buddhists.

00:02:28.148 --> 00:02:31.017 align:start size:84% position:16%
We care about people,
but we hate evil.

00:02:31.017 --> 00:02:32.618
We stand up against evil,

00:02:32.618 --> 00:02:34.520 align:start size:84% position:16%
and that's why we're
talking together.

00:02:34.520 --> 00:02:36.122 align:start size:84% position:16%
- Well, that's
exactly why I wanted

00:02:36.122 --> 00:02:38.091 align:start size:81% position:19%
to have you on the
show this week.

00:02:38.091 --> 00:02:40.326
So I wanna do a little recap.

00:02:40.326 --> 00:02:41.761
You've told the
story many times,

00:02:41.761 --> 00:02:43.596
you've written about
it and everything else,

00:02:43.596 --> 00:02:45.431
but I thought we could
just do a few minutes

00:02:45.431 --> 00:02:48.368 align:start size:84% position:16%
on your childhood,
growing up in Lebanon,

00:02:48.368 --> 00:02:49.636
and sort of what led you

00:02:49.636 --> 00:02:51.404
to being the person
that you are now.

00:02:51.404 --> 00:02:52.939
We'll just recap that briefly,

00:02:52.939 --> 00:02:54.607 align:start size:97% position:3%
and then I wanna talk to you
about the current events.

00:02:54.607 --> 00:02:57.844
But your personal story, it's
just so absolutely incredible

00:02:57.844 --> 00:02:59.479
and so relevant
to, to everything

00:02:59.479 --> 00:03:01.347
that's happening in
the world right now.

00:03:01.347 --> 00:03:03.983
- Exactly, especially as
we watch what's happening

00:03:03.983 --> 00:03:07.386
between Lebanon and
Israel and Gaza.

00:03:07.386 --> 00:03:10.556
You know, I was born
and raised in Lebanon.

00:03:10.556 --> 00:03:12.825
Lebanon used to be
the only majority

00:03:12.825 --> 00:03:14.127
Christian country
in the Middle East.

00:03:14.127 --> 00:03:15.694
Most people don't know that.

00:03:15.694 --> 00:03:17.196
We were fair-minded.

00:03:17.196 --> 00:03:18.364
We were open-minded.

00:03:18.364 --> 00:03:19.231
We were tolerant.

00:03:19.231 --> 00:03:20.699
We were multicultural.

00:03:20.699 --> 00:03:23.703
We prided ourselves on
our multiculturalism.

00:03:23.703 --> 00:03:26.305 align:start size:84% position:16%
We welcomed everyone
into our country,

00:03:26.305 --> 00:03:28.373
including Palestinians,

00:03:28.373 --> 00:03:31.310
because we wanted to share
with them the Westernization,

00:03:31.310 --> 00:03:33.846
which we had created in the
heart of the Middle East.

00:03:33.846 --> 00:03:37.317 align:start size:97% position:3%
Unfortunately, David, we
took people into our country

00:03:37.317 --> 00:03:39.786
who did not share our values.

00:03:39.786 --> 00:03:44.390
My 9-11 happened to me in 1975

00:03:44.390 --> 00:03:48.428 align:start size:94% position:6%
when actually Palestinian
Radical Islamist

00:03:48.428 --> 00:03:50.362
blew up my home,

00:03:50.362 --> 00:03:51.364
bringing it down,

00:03:51.364 --> 00:03:52.798
burning me under the rubble,

00:03:52.798 --> 00:03:56.102 align:start size:97% position:3%
wounded, as they were trying
to take over our town.

00:03:56.102 --> 00:04:00.039
I ended up in the hospital
for two and a half months

00:04:00.039 --> 00:04:02.708 align:start size:88% position:13%
and later ended up
living in a bomb shelter

00:04:02.708 --> 00:04:05.577
in an eight by 10
room bomb shelter,

00:04:05.577 --> 00:04:10.082 align:start position:0%
without water, without very
little food and no electricity.

00:04:10.082 --> 00:04:13.286
And that's where I lived
for the next seven years

00:04:13.286 --> 00:04:16.422
of my life, robbed of my youth.

00:04:16.422 --> 00:04:20.093
So I understand I'm not
only a terrorism analyst

00:04:20.093 --> 00:04:22.762 align:start size:84% position:16%
who studied about
terrorism in college.

00:04:22.762 --> 00:04:26.132
I'm an eyewitness to terror
who live to tell about it,

00:04:26.132 --> 00:04:28.868
and that's why I
speak so forcefully

00:04:28.868 --> 00:04:32.238 align:start size:94% position:6%
and so passionately about
standing up to those

00:04:32.238 --> 00:04:34.039
who want to perpetrate evil.

00:04:34.039 --> 00:04:37.043
If we good people don't
stand up and speak out,

00:04:37.043 --> 00:04:39.178
who else is going to do it?

00:04:39.178 --> 00:04:41.380 align:start size:88% position:13%
- Yeah, and as you know,
my friend Gadd Sadd,

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:44.417
I'm sure you know, Gadd, his
parents were actually kidnapped

00:04:44.417 --> 00:04:46.886 align:start size:84% position:16%
by Palestinian
terrorists in Lebanon.

00:04:46.886 --> 00:04:49.121
He was Jewish or he is Jewish.

00:04:49.121 --> 00:04:50.323
You were Christian,

00:04:50.323 --> 00:04:51.324 align:start size:84% position:16%
but the point is
that Beirut was once

00:04:51.324 --> 00:04:52.725
the Paris of the Middle East.

00:04:52.725 --> 00:04:53.926
- That's right.

00:04:53.926 --> 00:04:55.428 align:start size:81% position:19%
- And it certainly
isn't anymore.

00:04:55.428 --> 00:04:57.296
And we'll see what happens
over the next couple weeks.

00:04:57.296 --> 00:04:59.198
But can you quickly just
tell your journey then

00:04:59.198 --> 00:05:00.700
of eventually how
you got to America,

00:05:00.700 --> 00:05:02.801 align:start size:84% position:16%
because there was
even a stop in Israel,

00:05:02.801 --> 00:05:04.737
which people would
find interesting,

00:05:04.737 --> 00:05:06.004
and then kind of
what got you here,

00:05:06.004 --> 00:05:08.808
and then we'll get
to today's issues.

00:05:08.808 --> 00:05:11.744
- Well, you know, I grew
up in the bomb shelter

00:05:11.744 --> 00:05:14.646 align:start size:81% position:19%
and Israel was
our only lifeline.

00:05:14.646 --> 00:05:16.949
I remember when we first
went into the bomb shelter,

00:05:16.949 --> 00:05:19.885 align:start size:97% position:3%
people would say, you know,
my father would say, you know,

00:05:19.885 --> 00:05:23.222
"America's gonna see all the
massacres happening in Lebanon,

00:05:23.222 --> 00:05:25.424
and America is gonna come
and France is gonna come,

00:05:25.424 --> 00:05:27.660
and all these big Christian
nations are gonna come."

00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:30.162
And we waited and we
waited and nobody came.

00:05:30.162 --> 00:05:32.665
And I remember three
years into the war,

00:05:32.665 --> 00:05:34.400
I was around 13 years old,

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:35.801
and we got a word that night

00:05:35.801 --> 00:05:38.037 align:start size:84% position:16%
that our town was
going to be shelled.

00:05:38.037 --> 00:05:40.473
And you know, a friend of ours,

00:05:40.473 --> 00:05:42.908
a Christian militia
fighter stopped by

00:05:42.908 --> 00:05:44.877 align:start size:84% position:16%
and he said, "I just
want you to know,

00:05:44.877 --> 00:05:47.880
if I don't see you tomorrow,
I wish you a merciful death,

00:05:47.880 --> 00:05:50.883 align:start size:97% position:3%
because I believe they're
gonna take us over tonight."

00:05:50.883 --> 00:05:54.287 align:start size:97% position:3%
And I remember David
dressing in my Sunday best,

00:05:54.287 --> 00:05:56.389
my Easter dress,

00:05:56.389 --> 00:05:58.757
because I wanted to look
pretty when I am dead,

00:05:58.757 --> 00:06:01.093
knowing that when they
come to slaughter me,

00:06:01.093 --> 00:06:03.362
there would be no
one to bury me.

00:06:03.362 --> 00:06:05.231
And I remember sobbing,

00:06:05.231 --> 00:06:07.232
begging my mother, "I
don't want to die."

00:06:07.232 --> 00:06:09.201
I'm only 13 years old.

00:06:09.201 --> 00:06:12.071
And there was nothing my
mother could say to me.

00:06:12.071 --> 00:06:14.807
And I remember sitting in the
corner of our bomb shelter,

00:06:14.807 --> 00:06:17.576
and my father started
reading from Psalms,

00:06:17.576 --> 00:06:20.312
"I shall walk into
the valley of death

00:06:20.312 --> 00:06:23.015
and fear no evil for
thou art with me."

00:06:23.015 --> 00:06:25.517
And my parents said
to me, they said,

00:06:25.517 --> 00:06:26.585
"We lived a long life.

00:06:26.585 --> 00:06:27.987
You are an only child.

00:06:27.987 --> 00:06:29.488
You are a young child.

00:06:29.488 --> 00:06:32.024
We will create a distraction
when they come to kill us.

00:06:32.024 --> 00:06:34.927 align:start size:88% position:13%
And you just run towards
the Israeli border

00:06:34.927 --> 00:06:36.362
and don't look back."

00:06:36.362 --> 00:06:38.497 align:start size:84% position:16%
You see, we live
two and a half miles

00:06:38.497 --> 00:06:39.899
from the Israeli border,

00:06:39.899 --> 00:06:42.334
and we knew if we
run to the Jews

00:06:42.334 --> 00:06:45.838
and beg for help, the Jews
are not going to slaughter us

00:06:45.838 --> 00:06:47.807 align:start size:81% position:19%
because we had
more shared values

00:06:47.807 --> 00:06:50.476 align:start size:84% position:16%
with them than we
had with the Muslims.

00:06:50.476 --> 00:06:53.645 align:start size:97% position:3%
Thank God I did not have to
make that decision that night,

00:06:53.645 --> 00:06:56.315 align:start size:97% position:3%
because that's the night when
Israel came in physically

00:06:56.315 --> 00:06:59.819 align:start size:97% position:3%
into Lebanon and established
the security zone

00:06:59.819 --> 00:07:02.387
and set up artillery
bases around our town.

00:07:02.387 --> 00:07:05.825 align:start size:97% position:3%
And that's how we went on
living for another five years

00:07:05.825 --> 00:07:10.162
until Israel invaded Lebanon,
working with the Christians,

00:07:10.162 --> 00:07:12.999 align:start size:97% position:3%
trying to help the Christians
take back their country,

00:07:12.999 --> 00:07:14.767
take back their democracy,

00:07:14.767 --> 00:07:17.169 align:start size:88% position:13%
and kick out the
radical Islamic element

00:07:17.169 --> 00:07:19.772
that had taken control of
the country at that time.

00:07:19.772 --> 00:07:22.674
And that's how we came
out of the bomb shelter.

00:07:22.674 --> 00:07:24.810 align:start size:84% position:16%
And back to
rebuilding our lives.

00:07:24.810 --> 00:07:28.514
I ended up moving
to Israel in 1984

00:07:28.514 --> 00:07:29.782
and becoming a news anchor

00:07:29.782 --> 00:07:31.116
for World News in
the Middle East

00:07:31.116 --> 00:07:32.551
based out of Jerusalem,

00:07:32.551 --> 00:07:34.253
covering world events.

00:07:34.253 --> 00:07:37.623
And it was there where I met
my American war correspondent,

00:07:37.623 --> 00:07:39.959
American husband, got married.

00:07:39.959 --> 00:07:41.226
And that's how I ended up coming

00:07:41.226 --> 00:07:42.461
to the United States,

00:07:42.461 --> 00:07:44.730 align:start size:81% position:19%
thinking I left
everything behind.

00:07:44.730 --> 00:07:48.367 align:start size:94% position:6%
My life story is detailed
in a New York Times

00:07:48.367 --> 00:07:51.437 align:start size:84% position:16%
bestseller title
"Because They Hate,"

00:07:51.437 --> 00:07:53.673
where I go into
far more details,

00:07:53.673 --> 00:07:54.974
like when my mother was wounded

00:07:54.974 --> 00:07:57.210
and we ended up in
an Israeli hospital.

00:07:57.210 --> 00:07:59.612
And so many stories in the book

00:07:59.612 --> 00:08:02.915
that would really move
you and shed a light

00:08:02.915 --> 00:08:05.017 align:start size:84% position:16%
about what's happening
in the Middle East

00:08:05.017 --> 00:08:07.420
right now, so you can understand

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:10.389
how far back this conflict goes.

00:08:10.389 --> 00:08:12.290
- Alright, so we'll link
to the book down below,

00:08:12.290 --> 00:08:13.926
and we're also gonna link
to our first interview

00:08:13.926 --> 00:08:15.794
where we spent the hour
really telling your story

00:08:15.794 --> 00:08:17.029
because you just did

00:08:17.029 --> 00:08:19.265
a very, very obviously
condensed version of it.

00:08:19.265 --> 00:08:20.967
But let's get to the issues

00:08:20.967 --> 00:08:22.535
of the last two weeks or so.

00:08:22.535 --> 00:08:27.607
I take it that even with
the horrific barbarity

00:08:28.741 --> 00:08:30.243
and the medieval like
nature of all of this,

00:08:30.243 --> 00:08:32.545 align:start size:81% position:19%
that you probably,
of all people,

00:08:32.545 --> 00:08:34.847
were not particularly surprised.

00:08:34.847 --> 00:08:37.282 align:start size:88% position:13%
I mean, did the
Barbarity surprise you?

00:08:37.282 --> 00:08:40.219 align:start size:94% position:6%
I know the events probably
didn't surprise you.

00:08:41.320 --> 00:08:44.256 align:start size:84% position:16%
- What surprised me
was the attack itself,

00:08:44.256 --> 00:08:46.325 align:start size:81% position:19%
that it was not
stopped by Israel.

00:08:46.325 --> 00:08:49.528
That surprised the
world, not just me.

00:08:49.528 --> 00:08:51.831 align:start size:84% position:16%
Israelis are known for
their intelligence,

00:08:51.831 --> 00:08:54.600 align:start size:88% position:13%
but the massacre itself
did not surprise me

00:08:54.600 --> 00:08:58.904
because I understand
how much they hate.

00:08:58.904 --> 00:09:01.741
And that's why I titled my
book, "Because They Hate."

00:09:01.741 --> 00:09:04.476
The venom that are being fed

00:09:04.476 --> 00:09:07.947 align:start size:84% position:16%
from their mother's
milk to hate the Jews.

00:09:07.947 --> 00:09:10.215 align:start size:84% position:16%
Arab children from
the time they're born,

00:09:10.215 --> 00:09:13.085
they teach their children
how much to hate the Jews.

00:09:13.085 --> 00:09:15.021
And that's a sad reality

00:09:15.021 --> 00:09:16.355
because even in my country,

00:09:16.355 --> 00:09:17.890 align:start size:81% position:19%
when I was growing
up in Lebanon,

00:09:17.890 --> 00:09:19.591 align:start size:84% position:16%
remember Lebanon
was the only country

00:09:19.591 --> 00:09:20.726
to accept the third wave

00:09:20.726 --> 00:09:23.229 align:start size:88% position:13%
of Palestinian refugees
into the country

00:09:23.229 --> 00:09:25.097
in 1974, '75.

00:09:25.097 --> 00:09:26.966
I was a 10 year old little girl.

00:09:26.966 --> 00:09:28.501
My father owned a restaurant,

00:09:28.501 --> 00:09:29.968
and we were watching the images

00:09:29.968 --> 00:09:33.805 align:start position:0%
of the Palestinians coming
into Lebanon on our television,

00:09:33.805 --> 00:09:35.307
the first TV in town.

00:09:35.307 --> 00:09:37.043
And I would hear
the conversations

00:09:37.043 --> 00:09:39.044
on the tables in the restaurant,

00:09:39.044 --> 00:09:40.179 align:start size:84% position:16%
you know, people
talking to each other.

